id: chip
name: Chips (assist, filter, input, suggestion)
category: actions
summary: Compact 32dp controls. Filter chips toggle and show a check when selected.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Height 32dp, shape small (8dp). A chip is a rounded rectangle, not a pill (a pill is a button).
- Label Large. Padding 16dp, 8dp on the side that has an icon.
- Filter chip selected: secondary-container fill, check icon, no outline. Unselected: 1px outline.
- Group related chips in a set with an aria-label. Wrap on narrow widths rather than scroll.
- Touch target is 48dp tall through the ::after hit area.
@@a11y
- A filter chip is a <button aria-pressed>. Every chip in the set carries aria-pressed, updated wherever selection changes.
- An assist or suggestion chip is a plain button or link with a visible label.
- The leading check icon is aria-hidden.
@@html
<div class="md-chip-set" role="group" aria-label="Asset class">
  <button class="md-chip" type="button" aria-pressed="true">
    <span class="md-icon md-chip__check" aria-hidden="true">check</span>
    Metals
  </button>
  <button class="md-chip" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Energy</button>
  <button class="md-chip" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Crypto</button>
</div>
@@css
.md-chip-set {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--sp-sm);
}

.md-chip {
  --_bg: transparent;
  --_c: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-sm);
  min-height: 2rem;
  padding: 0 var(--sp-lg);
  border: 0.0625rem solid var(--md-outline);
  border-radius: var(--shape-sm);
  background-color: var(--_bg);
  color: var(--_c);
  font-family: var(--md-font-plain);
  font-size: var(--md-type-label-large-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-label-large-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-label-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-label-large-tracking);
  cursor: pointer;
  user-select: none;
  transition:
    background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects),
    border-radius var(--md-spring-fast-spatial-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-spatial);
}

/* 48dp touch target without growing the visible chip */
.md-chip::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -0.5rem 0;
}

.md-chip .md-icon { font-size: 1.125rem; }
.md-chip__check { display: none; }

.md-chip:hover  { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 8%, var(--_bg)); }
.md-chip:focus-visible { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg)); }
.md-chip:active { border-radius: var(--shape-md); }

.md-chip[aria-pressed="true"] {
  --_bg: var(--md-secondary-container);
  --_c: var(--md-on-secondary-container);
  padding-inline-start: var(--sp-sm);
  border-color: transparent;
}
.md-chip[aria-pressed="true"] .md-chip__check { display: inline-block; }

.md-chip:disabled {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 12%, transparent);
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--md-on-surface) 38%, transparent);
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}
@@js
// Multi-select filter chips. For single-select, clear the others before setting the clicked one.
document.addEventListener('click', function (ev) {
  var chip = ev.target.closest('.md-chip-set > .md-chip[aria-pressed]');
  if (!chip) return;
  chip.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(chip.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true'));
});
